# Purpose

This document defines the background processing engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish architectural principles for executing asynchronous work while preserving business consistency, operational reliability, and long-term maintainability.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Background processing philosophy
* Asynchronous execution
* Job ownership
* Processing consistency
* Background governance
* Platform evolution

It intentionally excludes scheduling technologies, queue implementations, execution frameworks, infrastructure configuration, and platform-specific background processing mechanisms, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to asynchronous processing, ensuring deferred work remains reliable, observable, and aligned with business architecture.

